Founder-approved one-time release trigger: deploy the exact main commit containing the merged and tested ATLAS demand observability, verified-source counting gate, stale-offer guard, and PayanAgent circuit fix (open on first HTTP 5xx with the existing 15-minute initial cooldown). The existing production-deploy workflow must pass the full test suite before deploying and verify /health git_sha equals GITHUB_SHA. No schema change, D1 migration, demand qualification change, 30-day rule change, or direct D1 write is part of this release.
